# E30 SkynetNumeric, the variant commented in its Program.cs: parallel: a variant of the oracles (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/SkynetNumericParallel/), compared as SkynetNumeric (rules/SkynetNumeric.rules).
cover all
fact sum ^Long Sum = (\d+)$
fact duration ^\d+\.000 ms$
same sum seq
same duration count
check sum count == 1
